resources.string:
1. By clicking "Start Authentication," you voluntarily agree to utilize the real avatar authentication and real-person real-name authentication functions and consent to the following authorization;

2. You acknowledge and agree that real avatar authentication involves comparing the account avatar with the user's facial information through technical means to ensure the account avatar matches the user's appearance. Please understand that due to technical limitations, there is still a possibility that the account avatar may not precisely match the account user's identity;

3. You grant us the permission to activate your device's camera, collect your facial information using face recognition technology from Tencent, Alibaba, Huoshan, and other suppliers, and compare it with images from Tencent, Alibaba, Huoshan, MOMO, and other suppliers. This comparison aims to authenticate your real avatar by matching facial information with all your avatars on the TanTan profile page, or by using the collected facial information to validate the data associated with any new avatars you upload; 

4. You consent to and authorize the external display of your real avatar and real avatar certification label;

5. Personal information retenton:

 (1) We obtain your personal information when you use the service Your personal information will be stored and retained from the date until you cancel your account;

(2) After your personal information exceeds the necessary retention period, we will delete or anonymize your personal information, but Except as otherwise provided by laws and regulations; 

 (3) When our products or services cease operations, we will notify you in the form of push notifications, announcements, etc., and delete your personal information within a reasonable period. Information may be anonymized. 

6. SDK related information is provided as follows:

1. By choosing the real name authentication function, you are required to simultaneously use the real avatar authentication function. Please carefully consider your decision before proceeding. By clicking "Start Authentication," you voluntarily agree to utilize both the real name and real avatar authentication functions, and you consent to the following terms and authorizations;


2. You acknowledge and agree that real avatar authentication is a technical process involving image comparison between your account's avatar and your facial information. This process is solely intended to ensure that your account's avatar accurately represents your appearance. Authentication is conducted to collect your facial and identity information through technical means, which is then compared to your registered information in the public security system. This authentication process is designed to confirm that you are a real person, and that the information you have provided matches the data held by the public security system. However, please be aware that due to technical limitations, there may be instances where the authentication results, such as the account avatar and user identity, do not perfectly align;


3. You hereby grant us authorization to access the camera on your device. We will employ facial recognition technology from suppliers such as Tencent, Alibaba, and Huoshan to collect your facial information. This information will be compared to all the avatars on your TanTan personal profile page, utilizing image comparison technology provided by these suppliers. This process is performed to authenticate your real avatar. Additionally, the collected facial information may be used to verify your newly uploaded avatars for real avatar authentication;


4. You further agree and authorize us to access the camera on your device. Using the face recognition technology provided by suppliers such as Tencent, Alibaba, and Huoshan, we will collect your facial information and match it with the name and ID number you have entered. This data matching process serves the purpose of real-name authentication;



5. You consent to and authorize the display of your real avatar, real avatar authentication label, and real-name authentication label;


6. Once you successfully pass the real-person authentication process, you will not be required to re-authenticate when accessing other platform functions or services that necessitate real-name authentication. These services may include, but are not limited to, live broadcasting, creating public rooms in chat rooms, applying for cash withdrawals, FUN information station, and more;


7. Personal information retenton:
(1) We will store and retain your personal information from the date you acquire your personal information during your use of the service until you choose to cancel your account;
(2) Once your personal information surpasses the necessary retention period, we will either delete or anonymize it, unless otherwise mandated by applicable laws and regulations;
(3) In the event that our products or services cease operation, we will notify you through push notifications, announcements, or other appropriate means. Subsequently, we will delete or anonymize your personal information within a reasonable timeframe. 


